<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Studio Kate | Masajes, Relajación y Fisioterapia</title>
    <style>
        /* ==========================================
           RESET & VARIABLES GLOBALES
           ========================================== */
        :root {
            --primary: #2C4A3E;      /* Verde Bosque Profundo */
            --primary-light: #4D6B5F;
            --accent: #D4AF37;       /* Dorado Sutil */
            --bg-light: #FAF8F5;     /* Crema / Lino */
            --bg-card: #FFFFFF;      /* Blanco Puro */
            --text-main: #2D312E;    /* Pizarra Oscuro */
            --text-muted: #66706B;   /* Gris Verdoso */
            --border-color: #E2DDD5;
            --font-title: 'Georgia', serif;
            --font-body: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .text-center { text-align: center; }
        
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: rgba(44, 74, 62, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(44, 74, 62, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--primary);
            background-color: transparent;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           HEADER & NAVEGACIÓN
           ========================================== */
        header {
            background-color: rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.95);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }

        .nav-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-main);
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* ==========================================
           HERO SECTION
           ========================================== */
        .hero {
            padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 80vh;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            line-height: 1.15;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hero-img-box {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        .hero-img-box img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 500px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           SECCIÓN CERTIFICACIONES & LOGROS
           ========================================== */
        .trust-section {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 2.5rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-card {
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           SERVICIOS / TRATAMIENTOS
           ========================================== */
        .services-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
        }

        .section-header {
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .service-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        }

        .service-img {
            height: 220px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .service-body {
            padding: 1.8rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .service-title {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .service-desc {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .service-meta {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .service-price {
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .service-time {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           SECCIÓN SOBRE KATE
           ========================================== */
        .about-section {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 6rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-img {
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: 100%;
            height: 450px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .about-content h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-content p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .cert-box {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }

        .cert-box strong {
            color: var(--primary);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           CONTACTO / UBICACIÓN
           ========================================== */
        .contact-section {
            padding: 6rem 0;
        }

        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .contact-info {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .contact-info h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-item {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-item strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .booking-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .booking-card h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .booking-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           FOOTER
           ========================================== */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            padding: 3rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .footer-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           RESPONSIVE (MEDIA QUERIES)
           ========================================== */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero-grid,
            .about-grid,
            .contact-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2.5rem;
            }

            .services-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .services-grid,
            .stats-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .nav-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .hero-actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .footer-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- HEADER / NAVEGACIÓN -->
    <header>
        <div class="container nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="logo">Studio <span>Kate</span></a>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#inicio">Inicio</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#servicios">Tratamientos</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#nosotros">Sobre Kate</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section id="inicio" class="hero">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="badge">Bienestar & Salud Integral</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">Tu espacio de relajación y fisioterapia</h1>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    Restaura el equilibrio de tu cuerpo y mente a través de masajes terapéuticos profesionales y terapias de rehabilitación adaptadas a tus necesidades.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">Reservar Cita</a>
                    <a href="#servicios" class="btn btn-outline">Ver Tratamientos</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-img-box">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544161515-4ab6ce6db874?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Masaje Terapéutico en Studio Kate">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECCIÓN DE CONFIANZA / STATS -->
    <section class="trust-section">
        <div class="container stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">+100</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Clientes Satisfechos</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">SEREMI</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Certificación de Salud</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Atención Personalizada</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TRATAMIENTOS & SERVICIOS -->
    <section id="servicios" class="services-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header text-center">
                <span class="badge">Nuestros Servicios</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Tratamientos Especializados</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="services-grid">
                <!-- Servicio 1 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600334089648-b0d9d3028eb2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Masaje Descontracturante" class="service-img">
                    <div class="service-body">
                        <h3 class="service-title">Masaje Descontracturante</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">Alivia nudos profundos, tensión muscular acumulada y estrés físico derivado de la rutina diaria o mala postura.</p>
                        <div class="service-meta">
                            <span class="service-price">$35.000</span>
                            <span class="service-time">60 min</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Servicio 2 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519823551278-64ac92734fb1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Masaje de Relajación" class="service-img">
                    <div class="service-body">
                        <h3 class="service-title">Masaje de Relajación</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">Técnica suave con aceites aromáticos pensada para calmar el sistema nervioso, reducir la ansiedad y reconectar cuerpo y mente.</p>
                        <div class="service-meta">
                            <span class="service-price">$30.000</span>
                            <span class="service-time">60 min</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Servicio 3 -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Fisioterapia Evaluativa" class="service-img">
                    <div class="service-body">
                        <h3 class="service-title">Fisioterapia Evaluativa</h3>
                        <p class="service-desc">Tratamiento kinesiológico focalizado en la recuperación de lesiones, movilidad articular y alivio de dolores crónicos.</p>
                        <div class="service-meta">
                            <span class="service-price">$40.000</span>
                            <span class="service-time">50 min</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOBRE KATE -->
    <section id="nosotros" class="about-section">
        <div class="container about-grid">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594824813570-78a333e1033d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Terapeuta Studio Kate" class="about-img">
            <div class="about-content">
                <span class="badge">Profesionalismo Garantizado</span>
                <h2>Conoce Studio Kate</h2>
                <p>
                    En Studio Kate nos enfocamos en brindar una experiencia integral de salud y descanso. Cada sesión es tratada de manera individual para adaptar las técnicas a tus necesidades exactas.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Nos enorgullece contar con el respaldo de más de 100 clientes que han transformado su bienestar físico y emocional con nuestros tratamientos.
                </p>

                <div class="cert-box">
                    <strong>Acreditación Sanitaria SEREMI de Salud</strong>
                    Nuestras instalaciones y procedimientos cumplen rigurosamente con toda la normativa sanitaria vigente para tu total tranquilidad y seguridad.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACTO Y RESERVAS -->
    <section id="contacto" class="contact-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="contact-grid">
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Información de Contacto</h3>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <strong>Ubicación</strong>
                            <p>Av. Principal 1234, Oficina 502<br>Santiago, Chile</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <strong>Horario de Atención</strong>
                            <p>Lunes a Viernes: 09:00 - 20:00 hrs<br>Sábados: 10:00 - 15:00 hrs</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-item">
                            <strong>Contacto Directo</strong>
                            <p>WhatsApp: +56 9 1234 5678<br>Email: contacto@studiokate.cl</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.8;">
                        Atención presencial solo con reserva previa.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="booking-card">
                    <h3>Agenda tu Sesión</h3>
                    <p>Contáctanos directamente para coordinar la disponibilidad de tu próxima sesión de masajes o fisioterapia.</p>
                    <a href="https://wa.me/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary" style="display: block; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        Reservar vía WhatsApp
                    </a>
                    <a href="mailto:contacto@studiokate.cl" class="btn btn-outline" style="display: block; text-align: center;">
                        Enviar un Correo
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-container">
            <div class="footer-logo">Studio Kate</div>
            <div>&copy; 2026 Studio Kate. Todos los derechos reservados. Certificación SEREMI de Salud.</div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>